  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhHmyU-RJNjLepdcnUn3n2YsUyQC7CnqaUF33j8r467gK82DRz6OrvyoB6hJeoJLONQSKcQA5jFt4g0Afm-aIXG37-lu1VLWO0EOBsNKsyTdLiepuMTF9aV3ycxRscN4nMAsuwMsjxgt0f454d2PNOhBjFCzWrQDyRzGMRll3payhye3ChfN7VvpP4i7A/s4096/%E6%9C%80%E7%BE%8E%E7%9A%84%E9%A2%A8%E6%99%AF.png\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"2048\" data-original-width=\"4096\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhHmyU-RJNjLepdcnUn3n2YsUyQC7CnqaUF33j8r467gK82DRz6OrvyoB6hJeoJLONQSKcQA5jFt4g0Afm-aIXG37-lu1VLWO0EOBsNKsyTdLiepuMTF9aV3ycxRscN4nMAsuwMsjxgt0f454d2PNOhBjFCzWrQDyRzGMRll3payhye3ChfN7VvpP4i7A/w640-h320/%E6%9C%80%E7%BE%8E%E7%9A%84%E9%A2%A8%E6%99%AF.png\" width=\"640\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgyBZO-HnNf-mEDDE_5wFJW7kRY-sW0FufwwR0U1sV8alfZz3SvmN5xszX9E-_EGAhCyViUAI3qScrS1NfhEPNiCN1IsNic-iqqt5sa917oBJtU_te4tTyNklB_8Z8CYQ51w_c5hktw2X-ovnWmtPeBvTx0tVz5hUvpmEVixQIGY7SeTMsqupgje6K-mQ/s1421/338%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1421\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgyBZO-HnNf-mEDDE_5wFJW7kRY-sW0FufwwR0U1sV8alfZz3SvmN5xszX9E-_EGAhCyViUAI3qScrS1NfhEPNiCN1IsNic-iqqt5sa917oBJtU_te4tTyNklB_8Z8CYQ51w_c5hktw2X-ovnWmtPeBvTx0tVz5hUvpmEVixQIGY7SeTMsqupgje6K-mQ/w450-h640/338%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: large;\">作品名稱</span></b></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">《最美的風景》</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Betunux Balay Ngngayan</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">繪本插圖</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>作品說明：</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">繪本tuì真實ê性命經驗改編，冊內底ê「Dumas」kap「Pilin」，現此時分別從事影像工作kap高山協作員。就算無仝途，in lóng拍拚beh kā Tayal( 泰雅族）人ê山林文化落實tī工作kap性命中。希望分享tsit段人生旅程，hōo lán ē記得細漢時起頭ê夢想。雖bóng世界噪耳ak-tsak，夢想ē tshuā lán行出家己ê路。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">繪本有Tayal（泰雅族）語、台語朗讀音檔QR Code。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">作者：吳易蓁</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">出版社：玉山社</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">http://www.tipi.com.tw</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">ISBN：9789862943113</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>作者紹介：</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">吳易蓁。文字、影像、戲劇工作者，愛狗仔，是兩个囡仔ê阿母，夾腳拖劇團團長。目前投入kap母語、人權、親子議題結合ê創作。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 q66pz984 b1v8xokw\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8Abong%E5%A0%B1?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZWDjUJsSxaPbx9rBf3emvc0qX31sZFFUgNNqOtI9vv64OwqXsGEcwI3lw-EjolqeunKDULXB2AzmrXPdDewdlrZi72lKhnFv6ZPAhhxYvK8KMzXeD-ekv7Y_z6BLYVkK4MlRank2JL7XQR1R13adh_SDiIvZcpr6jdEpFHPKpL2oc7EsEvYcOny0uZTPG13xlE&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" role=\"link\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; background-color: transparent; border-color: initial; border-style: initial; border-width: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; cursor: pointer; display: inline; font-family: inherit; list-style: none; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; text-align: inherit; text-decoration-line: none; touch-action: manipulation;\" tabindex=\"0\">#台文通訊BONG報</a></span><span face=\"&quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: white; text-align: left; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> 338期，2022年5月出刊。</span></b></span></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div align=\"center\"><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; 